    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d767">

                <pb facs="0927" n="833" sameAs="frus:frus1896/pg833"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Williams to Mr. Rockhill.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Habana</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1896-04-24"><hi rendition="#italic">April 24, 1896</hi></date>.
                        (Received 4.50 p.m.)</dateline></opener>
                <p>Superior court yesterday quashed charges against Sanguily of being concerned in
                    kidnaping Fernandez Castro.</p>
            </div>
